// csnz.dat and studio.dat entity definitions (modes other than Zombi).
//
// Evidence: OBSERVED facts are cited where used; every number not cited is
// DESIGN or STOCK-CS (CS 1.6 defaults). Weapons are the CS guns of
// decls/def/cs_weapons.def (STOCK-CS stats, not CSNZ parity). Each class's
// loadout keeps the role of the Quake weapon it replaced (DESIGN).
// CS speeds (STOCK-CS): 250 running with a knife, 130 walking. Nuclide moves
// at pm_walkspeed unless sprinting, so pm_walkspeed holds the CS run speed.

